From 6e5da481fc9eed30c98f3336aaf05941f98def81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:34:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Verify source signatures with openpgpverify

Replace the GnuPG-based %gpgverify with %openpgpverify, which uses
Sequoia sqv and takes the same options, as part of the Fedora 45 Change
https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Sequoia_openpgpverify

Update gpgkey-0FDE7BE0E88F5E48.gpg to the current copy at
https://emersion.fr/.well-known/openpgpkey/hu/dj3498u4hyyarh35rkjfnghbjxug6b19,
the URL the spec names for it (same certificate(s)).

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 drm_info.spec               |   4 ++--
 gpgkey-0FDE7BE0E88F5E48.gpg | Bin 7501 -> 2263 bytes
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drm_info.spec b/drm_info.spec
index 24a5b3a..3274010 100644
--- a/drm_info.spec
+++ b/drm_info.spec
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ Source1:        %{url}/-/releases/v%{version}/downloads/%{name}-%{version}.tar.g
 Source2:        https://emersion.fr/.well-known/openpgpkey/hu/dj3498u4hyyarh35rkjfnghbjxug6b19#/gpgkey-0FDE7BE0E88F5E48.gpg
 
 BuildRequires:  gcc
-BuildRequires:  gnupg2
+BuildRequires:  openpgpverify
 BuildRequires:  meson >= 0.56.0
 BuildRequires:  pkgconfig(json-c)
 BuildRequires:  pkgconfig(libdisplay-info)
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ BuildRequires:  python3-devel
 
 
 %prep
-%{gpgverify} --keyring='%{SOURCE2}' --signature='%{SOURCE1}' --data='%{SOURCE0}'
+%{openpgpverify} --keyring='%{SOURCE2}' --signature='%{SOURCE1}' --data='%{SOURCE0}'
 %autosetup
 
 
diff --git a/gpgkey-0FDE7BE0E88F5E48.gpg b/gpgkey-0FDE7BE0E88F5E48.gpg
index cc3b6a06af86e73144a2da89ca2f6616fcdd9dcb..1080404a42cdfdbd0a18b23fb6670e713d30f2c0 100644
GIT binary patch
